+    # AGC-Fold5 fix: the logical main camera (id "0") black-screens on the Fold 5.
+    # Samsung UniHAL puts third-party sessions on the 3RD_PARTY_BYPASS path and
+    # rejects the logical device's multi-physical stream layout
+    # (CheckEnableCondition: isValidStreamConfiguration=false) - the session
+    # configures but the repeating preview request is never started. The physical
+    # main lens (id "56") serves the same framing with full LEVEL_3 RAW access,
+    # so when both are in the filtered list, drop the logical "0" and keep "56".
+    # On devices without "56" this is a no-op, so other Samsungs keep their main.
